wJo v4.5.2 analysis software (Tree Star Inc., OR, USA), utilising the Dean&#x02013;Jett&#x02013;Fox model, analysing 10&#x02009;000 events.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Results of annexin V-PE flow cytometry upon 72&#x02009;h exposure to chemotherapy</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th colspan="3" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Cells, &#x00025; (&#x000b1;s.e.m.)</bold></th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Chemotherapy</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Dose</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Annexin V-PE and 7-AAD negative</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Annexin V-PE positive and 7-AAD negative</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Annexin V-PE and 7-AAD positive</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Control</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">93 (1)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4 (1)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2 (0)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Epirubicin</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">LD<sub>10</sub></td><td align="